          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "none",
          "guid": "mswkptc9ovc14oam",
          "message": {
            "text": "Box-only generated content participates in flex layout exactly like text generated content. Anchoring the last empty ::after margin box to the content-right edge reuses the CSS flex invariant already applied to textual pseudos; centering uses the host content box so borders and padding are not double-counted. The affected visual fixture drops from 13 regions to 5 without any summary- or chevron-specific branch.",
            "markdown": "Box-only generated content participates in flex layout exactly like text generated content. Anchoring the last empty ::after margin box to the content-right edge reuses the CSS flex invariant already applied to textual pseudos; centering uses the host content box so borders and padding are not double-counted. The affected visual fixture drops from 13 regions to 5 without any summary- or chevron-specific branch."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/script/walker/pseudo-content.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 416,
                  "endLine": 433,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "            borderBoxY = rect.top - vp.y + hostBorT + hostPadT + pMarT;\n            // An empty decorative pseudo is still a real flex item. When an\n            // `::after` is the last item and main-axis distribution pushes the\n            // ends apart, its margin box is flush with the content-right edge.\n            // Text pseudos already take this path below; box-only pseudos must\n            // use the same flex geometry instead of the static content-start.\n            const hostFlex = cs.display === 'flex' || cs.display === 'inline-flex';\n            const justify = cs.justifyContent || '';\n            const pushesEnd = justify.indexOf('space-between') >= 0 || justify.indexOf('flex-end') >= 0\n              || justify === 'end' || justify === 'right';\n            if (pseudo === '::after' && hostFlex && pushesEnd) {\n              const hostPadR = parseFloat(cs.paddingRight) || 0;\n              const pMarR = parseFloat(pcs.marginRight) || 0;\n              borderBoxX = rect.right - vp.x - hostBorR - hostPadR - pMarR - borderBoxW;\n              if (cs.alignItems === 'center') {\n                const hostBorB = parseFloat(cs.borderBottomWidth) || 0;\n                const hostPadB = parseFloat(cs.paddingBottom) || 0;\n                const contentH = rect.height - hostBorT - hostBorB - hostPadT - hostPadB;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
